print(find_kth_largest(nums, k))
```

The solution utilizes the Quickselect algorithm, a selection algorithm with an average time complexity of O(n). It partitions the array around a pivot, similar to Quicksort, but only recurses on the relevant partition containing the k-th largest element, significantly improving efficiency compared to sorting.

